          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: આસાન",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આસાન — āsān — \"effortless\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે આ રીત વાપરશો તો કામ આસાન બનશે. jo tame ā rīt vāparśo to kām āsān banśe. If you use this method, the work will become easy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આસાન (āsān) is usually traced to Persian āsān, \"easy\"; the everyday Gujarati word beside it is સહેલું."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
